OL,3,GNEWSATraining exercise to take place on
OL,4,ATamar Bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planned multi-agency emergency
OL,7,Ftraining exercise is set to take place
OL,8,Fon Tamar Bridge which links Devon and
OL,9,FCornwall.
OL,11,FTamar Crossings, National Highways and
OL,12,Femergency service partners, will carry
OL,13,Fout the exercise from 19:30 BST on the
OL,14,Fbridge over the River Tamar between
OL,15,FSaltash and Plymouth.
OL,17,FThe bridge has been chosen for the
OL,18,Fexercise because of its "unique
OL,19,Fcharacteristics, operational
OL,20,Frequirements and importance to the
OL,21,Fregional transport network", Tamar
OL,22,FCrossings said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
