OL,3,GNEWSATraining exercise to take place on
OL,4,ATamar Bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bridge is expected to remain open
OL,7,Fthroughout the exercise, with
OL,8,Farrangements in place to maintain
OL,9,Faccess for vehicles, pedestrians and
OL,10,Fcyclists.
